<item>
            <title>[LU-20317] sanity/398u fails on aarch64 - incorrect PAGE_SIZE</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20317</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for stancheff &amp;lt;stancheff@cray.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f29d1253-66c3-4e9a-9cae-035055e32908&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f29d1253-66c3-4e9a-9cae-035055e32908&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125708&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125708&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-503.40.1.el9_5.aarch64+64k&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125708&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125708&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Issue was introduced in patch &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/64351&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/64351&lt;/a&gt; (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19536&quot; title=&quot;fault_in_iov_iter_readable() with a spinlock held&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19536&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19536&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: drain and retry on DIO pool ENOMEM&quot;) that just landed on 2026-05-28 and added test_398u.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test should use PAGE_SIZE instead of 4096&lt;/p&gt;</description>
